                <pb facs="0900" n="863" sameAs="frus:frus1977-80v16/pg863"/>


                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#bold">Paper Prepared in the National Security
                        Council</hi><anchor n="3" xml:id="d283-f1"/>
                </head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#bold">APPENDIX</hi>
                </p>
                <p>To a very limited extent, the top to bottom listings of agencies within
                    categories B–E reflect relative increasing gradations of intensity. However,
                    distinguishing among the agencies in each category is largely an intuitive
                    process.</p>
